bluejetty:00127164:ios.description:
Play the world's most popular FREE Blackjack 21 game with millions of players around the world! Place your bet, feel the risk and win chips! To win at blackjack, you need to score as many points as possible without “going bust” (over 21). The object of Blackjack is to get as close to 21 as possible, without going over. The great popularity of the game is determined by simple rules, the speed of the game, and the simplest strategy in counting cards.
You can win the game by drawing 21 on your first two cards and the dealer not drawing the same. By drawing a higher hand value than the dealer. Or by the dealer drawing a hand value that is higher than 21.
When you play online Blackjack after the hands have been dealt, you have several choices for what to do next. Here are some game terms and definitions:
Hit - the player requests more cards from the dealer until he either bust (go over 21) or decide to stand;
Stand - the player is satisfied with his current hand. Therefore, he will not ask for another card and will finish the round standing;
Double - double player's original bet and get one additional card;
Split - when a player has two same value cards he can split them and play with two hands;
Surrender - if a player is not satisfied with cards, he can give them up in exchange for half of the initial bet;
Insurance - if the dealer has an Ace showing, then he can offer players insurance for Blackjack. In case of consent, the player places an additional insurance bet equal to half of the initial bet. If the dealer wins, then the player loses his initial bet but wins insurance bet;
Side Bets - casinos offer various side bets that you can place together with your initial bet;
Push - the player and the dealer tied.
Blackjack by Murka is a place where a good time lasts a long time. Download and play for Free!

